All rights reserved.

This repository's definitive production release is governed by the commercial
license terms in `COMMERCIAL_LICENSE.md`.

Release model
-------------

- The TRI-SYNC runtime is a standalone, zero-infrastructure system.
- Enterprise-only capabilities are unlocked offline with signed Ed25519 license
  documents verified locally by the runtime.
- The protocol specification in `SPEC.md` is published for interoperability and
  conformance purposes.

Historical notice
-----------------

Pre-1.0 experimental and serverless iterations of TRI-SYNC are retired and are
not the authoritative production architecture.

Authoritative documents
-----------------------

- `COMMERCIAL_LICENSE.md` — commercial terms for the software
- `docs/licensing.md` — operational offline licensing details
- `SPEC.md` — normative protocol specification
